OL,3,AMeghan could return to acting once back
OL,4,Ain UK
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Duchess of Sussex could make a
OL,7,Freturn to acting after she moves back
OL,8,Fto the UK, according to reports.
OL,10,FSources close to the Sussexes have not
OL,11,Fdenied reports that Meghan has been
OL,12,Foffered an acting role in the country.
OL,14,FAustralian outlet news.com.au, external
OL,15,Ffirst reported that one of the reasons
OL,16,Fbehind Harry and Meghan's decision to
OL,17,Freturn to Britain was that the duchess
OL,18,Fhad been offered a job in an upcoming
OL,19,Fproject.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
