OL,3,AWhy the US economy is ringing alarm
OL,4,Abells
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhat with a 250th birthday, Taylor
OL,7,FSwift's wedding and the football World
OL,8,FCup, Americans could be forgiven for
OL,9,Ftaking their eye off the ball this
OL,10,Fsummer.
OL,12,FBut signs of economic trouble have been
OL,13,Fbuilding. This week they hit the
OL,14,Fheadlines when US national debt passed
OL,15,Fthe $40tn (#29.4tn) mark, raising
OL,16,Fconcerns both at home and abroad.
OL,18,FIt took almost 200 years for US
OL,19,Fnational debt to reach $1tn for the
OL,20,Ffirst time, says Maya MacGuineas,
OL,21,Fpresident of the Committee for a
OL,22,FResponsible Federal Budget.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
