OL,3,AHong Kong's Tiananmen activists
OL,4,Aconvicted in national security trial
OL,5,
OL,6,FLee and Chow "incited other persons to
OL,7,Forganise, plan, commit or participate
OL,8,Fin acts by unlawful means with a view
OL,9,Fto subverting the state power",
OL,10,Faccording to a summary on Friday. Chow
OL,11,Ftold the court in May the law itself
OL,12,Fwas on trial.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
